# Build context exclusions for the Scopewatch image. THIS is the file BuildKit
# applies: for `-f products/scopewatch/Dockerfile .` it looks for a dockerignore
# named after the Dockerfile first, then for one at the context root. The
# sibling .dockerignore carries the same list so the exclusions are findable
# under the name people look for.
#
# The context is the REPO ROOT, so every pattern is relative to the repo root
# and uses **/ to match at any depth.

**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.git
**/.pytest_cache
**/node_modules
**/docs/deck
